16">Something </span><span begin="00:18.916" end="00:19.787">about </span><span begin="00:19.787" end="00:20.091">it </span><span begin="00:20.091" end="00:20.534">doesn't </span><span begin="00:20.534" end="00:20.755">sit </span><span begin="00:20.755" end="00:21.147">right </span><span begin="00:21.147" end="00:21.411">with </span><span begin="00:21.411" end="00:21.779">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.979" end="00:23.955"><span begin="00:21.979" end="00:22.179">And </span><span begin="00:22.179" end="00:22.595">how </span><span begin="00:22.595" end="00:22.980">could </span><span begin="00:22.980" end="00:23.171">it </span><span begin="00:23.171" end="00:23.955">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.267" end="00:30.976"><span begin="00:27.267" end="00:27.443">When </span><span begin="00:27.443" end="00:27.635">I </span><span begin="00:27.635" end="00:27.877">walk </span><span begin="00:27.877" end="00:28.936">away </span><span begin="00:28.936" end="00:29.232">it </span><span begin="00:29.232" end="00:29.640">always </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:30.048">comes </span><span begin="00:30.048" end="00:30.312">in </span><span begin="00:30.312" end="00:30.976">threes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.080" end="00:36.277"><span begin="00:32.080" end="00:32.256">We </span><span begin="00:32.256" end="00:32.442">don't </span><span begin="00:32.442" end="00:32.680">get </span><span begin="00:32.680" end="00:33.342">on </span><span begin="00:33.342" end="00:33.565">can't </span><span begin="00:33.565" end="00:33.805">make </span><span begin="00:33.805" end="00:34.205">you </span><span begin="00:34.205" end="00:34.573">laugh </span><span begin="00:34.573" end="00:36.277">personality</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.421" end="00:40.006"><span begin="00:36.421" end="00:36.718">But </span><span begin="00:36.718" end="00:36.933">I </span><span begin="00:36.933" end="00:37.181">don't </span><span begin="00:37.181" end="00:38.125">invest </